      "text": "At a rickety bridge, two goblins have hung a rope of tin cans by a sign: TOL BRIDJ. 5 SILVURS EECH. \"Halt, pay King Snag or else!\" \"Or else what, boss?\" whispers the round one, chewing an onion.",
