    {
      "id": "mine_gate",
      "title": "Pip at the Gate",
      "text": "A wall of junk blocks the tunnel. Behind it, a cat-sized kobold in a teapot helmet waves a fork on a stick: \"Halt, I am Pip, Fiercest Guard, and VERY dangerous!\" Then he sneezes.",
